# How much of the simplification rollout this install may act on. The rollout
# lands in four stages and each one needs its own merged revision installed
# before the policy it carries can be used. The revision record and the
# application order live in docs/plans/dux-simplification-rollout.md.
#
# m1  Review modes, classification, break-verification at the task that added
#     the guard, Dux-owned routing. Delivered-PR feedback rounds, same-session
#     answers and approval, prerequisite dispatch and usage reporting are all
#     unavailable; use existing recovery for any of them.
# m2  Adds delivered-PR feedback rounds, positive parking and same-PR updates.
# m3  Adds same-session answers, committed-plan approval, and dispatch that
#     waits on a verified predecessor.
# m4  Adds usage reporting.
#
# This is a statement about what is installed, never a request for it. Raise it
# only after the matching revision is recorded in the plan's table and installed
# here; a stage this checkout does not implement is a doctor failure rather than
# a way to turn one on early.
#
# Copy this file to config/policy-stage to change it. The installer seeds the
# value once and never edits one you wrote.
m1
